{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1890244e-9712-8fa8-8b7a-a2af23e25e69",
  "created_at": "2025-12-04T09:51:53-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Carmen Pagan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:49:02-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. Good morning, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:49:07-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. So, um, my name is Carmen Pagan, and I'm calling because my brother-in-law and I are taking over a little bar here in the Fifth Ward, the previous owners have been gone since October, and we've been going back and forth with the landlord about the paperwork for two months now. And honestly, every office sends me somewhere else."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:49:28-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's a hassle, I'm sorry. What's the question for us?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:49:33-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, so, the question. We want to have live music on Friday nights, just a guy with a guitar, maybe a small trio sometimes. Somebody told me the old owners had something for that, but I can't find it in any of the stuff they left. So do we need an entertainment license for the live music?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:49:53-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, if you're going to have live entertainment at a place that serves, you'd go through the license process here in the clerk's office. The old one wouldn't just carry over to you, it's usually tied to the owner and the location."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:50:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course it isn't. Okay. Great. So what's the fee?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:50:12-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have the exact amount in front of me, and it can depend on how the license is set up. Let me put you on a quick hold and check with the licensing desk. Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:50:26-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead. I'm just sitting here sewing anyway. I quilt, so I'm putting a border on a blanket while I wait. Nothing else to do on hold."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:50:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, how nice! Hang on one second for me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:50:40-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mm-hm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:50:41-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm back, thanks for waiting. So the fee is on the application form, and the licensing desk says it's best to pick up the form or look at it on the city website, because the amount is listed right there. You'd also need your liquor license information handy, and the address of the bar."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:51:00-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wait, so you can't just tell me the number? I've been on the phone with three offices."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:51:07-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I know, I know, it's frustrating. I'd rather you get the right figure from the form than hear something wrong from me. If you want, I can have someone call you back with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:51:19-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Yes, do that. My number is four oh one, five five five, oh one seven eight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:51:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one seven eight. And that's Carmen Pagan?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:51:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, Pagan, P-A-G-A-N. The bar's over on Gidley Street, three twenty-five, if they need it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:51:38-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, three twenty-five Gidley. I'll pass the message along today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:51:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you. I guess that's something."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:51:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Carmen. Enjoy the quilting, and good luck with the bar."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T09:51:51-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Bye."
    }
  ],
